{"seq":9,"slug":"lc0104-maximum-depth","title":"LeetCode 104 二叉树的最大深度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0104-maximum-depth","wordCount":920,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-104-二叉树的最大深度\">LeetCode 104 二叉树的最大深度</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个二叉树 <code>root</code>，返回其<strong>最大深度</strong>。</p>\n<p>二叉树的最大深度是指从根节点到最远叶子节点的最长路径上的节点数。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>树中节点的数量在 <code>[0, 10^4]</code> 范围内</li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = [3, 9, 20, null, null, 15, 7]&#10;      3&#10;     / \\&#10;    9  20&#10;       / \\&#10;      15   7&#10;输出：3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = [3, 9, 20, null, null, 15, 7]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    9  20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       / \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      15   7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：3</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = [1, null, 2]&#10;输出：2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = [1, null, 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：2</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = []&#10;输出：0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：0</span></span></code></pre></div><p>二叉树的最大深度是树形结构中最基础的度量之一。本题展示了 DFS（深度优先搜索）和 BFS（广度优先搜索）两种经典遍历策略在求解树的属性时的不同应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"深度的递归定义\">深度的递归定义</h3><p>一棵树的最大深度可以递归定义为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果树为空，深度为 0</li>\n<li>否则，深度 = 1 + max(左子树深度, 右子树深度)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这是一个「自底向上」的递归定义——先计算子树的深度，再合并得到当前树的深度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dfs-法-递归\">DFS 法（递归）</h3><p>根据上述定义，直接写出递归代码。递归函数返回以当前节点为根的子树深度，通过后序遍历（先递归子树，再处理当前节点）的方式自底向上计算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bfs-法-层序遍历\">BFS 法（层序遍历）</h3><p>另一种思路是使用层序遍历（BFS），统计树有多少层。每遍历完一层，深度加 1。当队列为空时，遍历结束，当前深度就是最大深度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>思路</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DFS（递归）</td>\n<td>自底向上合并深度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFS（层序）</td>\n<td>逐层遍历计数</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(w)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 h 为树高，w 为树的最大宽度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两种方法的适用场景\">两种方法的适用场景</h3><p>DFS 更适合求深度相关的属性（最大深度、路径和等），因为它天然地沿着路径深入。BFS 更适合求层级相关的属性（最小深度、层序遍历等），因为它逐层推进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"dfs-递归法-推荐\">DFS 递归法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TreeNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  left: TreeNode | null;&#10;  right: TreeNode | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function maxDepth(root: TreeNode | null): number {&#10;  if (root === null) {&#10;    return 0;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return 1 + Math.max(maxDepth(root.left), maxDepth(root.right));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxDepth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (root </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maxDepth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root.left), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">maxDepth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root.right));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"bfs-层序遍历法\">BFS 层序遍历法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxDepth(root: TreeNode | null): number {&#10;  if (root === null) {&#10;    return 0;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const queue: TreeNode[] = [root];&#10;  let depth = 0;&#10;&#10;  while (queue.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const levelSize = queue.length;&#10;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; levelSize; i++) {&#10;      const node = queue.shift()!;&#10;&#10;      if (node.left !== null) {&#10;        queue.push(node.left);&#10;      }&#10;      if (node.right !== null) {&#10;        queue.push(node.right);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    depth++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return depth;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxDepth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (root </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [root];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (queue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> levelSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> levelSize; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.left);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>DFS 递归执行过程：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>root = [3, 9, 20, null, null, 15, 7]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调用</th>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>左子树深度</th>\n<th>右子树深度</th>\n<th>返回值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>maxDepth(15)</td>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>maxDepth(7)</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>maxDepth(9)</td>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>maxDepth(20)</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>maxDepth(3)</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自底向上汇聚，最终根节点的深度为 3。</p>\n<p><strong>BFS 执行过程：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>队列内容</th>\n<th>处理节点</th>\n<th>depth</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第 1 层</td>\n<td>[3]</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 层</td>\n<td>[9, 20]</td>\n<td>9, 20</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 3 层</td>\n<td>[15, 7]</td>\n<td>15, 7</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结束</td>\n<td>[]</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"尾递归优化写法\">尾递归优化写法</h3><p>虽然 JavaScript 引擎普遍不支持尾调用优化，但从概念上可以改写为带累加器的形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function maxDepth(root: TreeNode | null): number {&#10;  const dfs = (node: TreeNode | null, depth: number): number =&gt; {&#10;    if (node === null) {&#10;      return depth;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return Math.max(dfs(node.left, depth + 1), dfs(node.right, depth + 1));&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return dfs(root, 0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxDepth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.left, depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.right, depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DFS 递归</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n<td>h 为树高，最坏 O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFS 层序</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(w)</td>\n<td>w 为最大层宽度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 两种方法都需要访问每个节点恰好一次，因此时间复杂度均为 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> DFS 的空间取决于递归深度，即树的高度。最坏情况（退化链表）为 O(n)，平衡树为 O(log n)。BFS 的空间取决于队列中同时存在的最多节点数，即树的最大宽度。完全二叉树的最后一层有约 n/2 个节点，因此 BFS 的空间为 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>深度 vs 高度：</strong> 需要注意「深度」和「高度」的区别：节点的深度是从根到该节点的路径长度，节点的高度是从该节点到最远叶子的路径长度。树的最大深度等于树的高度。在 LeetCode 中，深度从 1 开始计数（根节点深度为 1），这与某些教材从 0 开始计数的约定不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 104 二叉树的最大深度","id":"leetcode-104-二叉树的最大深度"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"深度的递归定义","id":"深度的递归定义"},{"level":3,"text":"DFS 法（递归）","id":"dfs-法-递归"},{"level":3,"text":"BFS 法（层序遍历）","id":"bfs-法-层序遍历"},{"level":3,"text":"两种方法的适用场景","id":"两种方法的适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"DFS 递归法（推荐）","id":"dfs-递归法-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"BFS 层序遍历法","id":"bfs-层序遍历法"},{"level":3,"text":"尾递归优化写法","id":"尾递归优化写法"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 101 对称二叉树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0101-symmetric-tree"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 136 只出现一次的数字","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0136-single-number"}}